# 🔐 AdminSphere — Secure User Management Dashboard

> **A modern, secure, and interactive user management system powered by React, Express.js, and Supabase.**

![AdminSphere](https://img.shields.io/badge/AdminSphere-User%20Management-2563EB?style=for-the-badge)
![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-Frontend-61DAFB?style=for-the-badge\&logo=react)
![Express](https://img.shields.io/badge/Express-Backend-000000?style=for-the-badge\&logo=express)
![Supabase](https://img.shields.io/badge/Supabase-Database-3ECF8E?style=for-the-badge\&logo=supabase)

## ✨ Overview

**AdminSphere** is a premium User Management Dashboard designed to demonstrate secure communication between a **React frontend**, **Express.js backend**, and **Supabase**. The application provides an attractive admin interface for viewing and managing user information through a dedicated `/admin/users` API endpoint.

The Express backend securely uses the **Supabase Service Role Key** to retrieve users, while the sensitive key remains completely hidden from the frontend. The dashboard combines secure backend architecture with a modern UI featuring glassmorphism, animated statistics, interactive user cards, 3D flip effects, image hover effects, search, filtering, pagination, analytics, and responsive layouts.

